  beats:
  - heading: Taken at the Gate
    text: "A shout goes up behind them. Hands seize Jonathan before he can raise
      his father's ring.\n\n\"Where is the son of Jesse?\" the commander demands.
      Jonathan says nothing \u2014 and in the confusion, no one is watching the gate."
    sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 25a3fe8e76d12934da1f6c93f6bd8e87, type: 3}
